   "sustainabilityFeatures": null,
   "description": "V7 Pink Lemonade is a vitamin-enhanced sparkling soda, teamed up with Dara's Ice Cream for a limited-edition collaboration - transforming the popular Pink Lemonade flavor into a creamy, scoopable frozen treat. A refreshing, summery spin created by Cairo-based Dar'’s Ice Cream in partnership with the vitamin-infused beverage brand V7. Captures the bright citrusy zing of V7’s Pink Lemonade soda, swirled into Dara’s signature artisanal ice cream texture. It is vitamin-infused sparkling drink, caffeine-free, naturally flavored, lightly carbonated and enriched with vitamins and honey extract. Vitamins and immunity support – typically fortified with B-complex vitamins (like B6, B12) and includes honey for an immune boost No preservatives and 100 percent natural flavors. Light carbonation and moderate sugar – treated as a healthier soda alternative.",
